{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55433","headline":"筑居 · 梅远","name":"筑居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔居苕之南，今适宛之北。\n溪山故缭绕，往来等乡国。\n爱此太古风，不但占林樾。\n岚气敬亭浮，波光响潭接。\n虽在城市傍，而与喧嚣隔。\n息心谢纷烦，投闲遗一切。\n结构类茅茨，宁复事雕餙。\n草堂亦易成，经营岂木石。\n喜见野人来，渐与尘迹绝。\n把我盈樽酒，妻儿同一啜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梅远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}